# NetForge — Pomodoro Focus Mode Redesign
Date: 2026-08-28

## Changes
- Replaced basic timer with full Pomodoro system
- Presets: Classic (25/5), Deep Focus (50/10), Sprint (15/3), Custom
- Custom: work, short break, long break, sessions before long break (2–5)
- Draggable circular bubble timer (position persisted)
- Tab title shows live countdown (⏱ work / ☕ break)
- Hover-only bubble controls (play/pause, skip, reset)
- Study material is primary view (today's plan or curriculum module)
- Block tabs, checklists, mark complete integration preserved

## New Files
- lib/pomodoro.ts, lib/focus-content.ts
- hooks/usePomodoro.ts
- components/PomodoroBubble.tsx, PomodoroSettingsPanel.tsx, StudyMaterial.tsx
